# Environment files
#
# Jukebox uses separate config per environment:
#
#   Development (local, no Cloudflare):
#     cp .env.development.example .env.development
#     bun run dev
#
#   Production (home server + Cloudflare Tunnel):
#     cp .env.production.example .env.production
#     docker compose up --build -d
#
# See README.md for Spotify app setup (use a separate Spotify app per environment).
